ed (4).png", "id": "1327505929431978", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304305_1327505932765311_5286460740341237931_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LX9_d3NS2foQ7kNvwHUKtu6&_nc_oc=Adp83O6LSNqgtKjRnHIZ-fZpvk3PN_w8nJu8Xkf3n0Kl0vR63GtwPLnUS518fxgqUDY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMvX6V2FXcboj7NWJXBvvbm1EG3OoTBtcEks8EDPf6DxA&oe=6ACA64A4"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (33).png", "id": "2076724189787348", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_2076724193120681_4871879008737988130_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V5alIHxSPvcQ7kNvwH0RaV5&_nc_oc=Adryo6lOQlyezrGuw0LW36_urcE8uLjjf5qjO2mID8KbCMm26_Fu-kAI-HvO3IgLDN4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNHDaoD5eBokWZcAvmWKoSKgb0qNk53xQxWy3wsQ91RcA&oe=6ACA7817"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00033.png", "id": "3932380693732122", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_3932380697065455_5087597325838508038_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bwL7aM-zu-EQ7kNvwHIIGEk&_nc_oc=Adol1SMt6mjszN4_db9hu0c5Lhsf093O_sWX1YwEkZ_bsRpvI74HrewvgWxdu1uxhqs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOY2mtLumrd4Dk-C-ZmFUNbxVgTRUhUQwVlqL3QeFvdjw&oe=6ACA56E2"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (34).png", "id": "890620570035576", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_890620573368909_3665044860292886222_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eBPbV1Nvs0gQ7kNvwHaCEpt&_nc_oc=AdqO0NbiojLEI2sLXygvcu6GQvmJF-6rU2o3IDP8T51Bw4_yfRyWMyGZlJLnLiO8Kv4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOOr1nesaKd6RhLf31zl7HdjmO4JJhEeA5hqrgHlNYxJQ&oe=6ACA51DB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ZombonkDungeon_CoverLandscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1640132164140436", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831279_1640132174140435_9218879251217414980_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UOTWXI2Hgc4Q7kNvwESrGtF&_nc_oc=Adp7PAdxzOLZ86u4qpYKtpX5iW_KbtoJ93P3HJ3g8K_UT2Bvn4VIal9h0CSGbAgvP8w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNxOmw8PiUcf2qPkxOUSMSfhecomeefU-PCinGalPbing&oe=6ACA48D2"}, "display_name": "ZOMBONK", "keywords": ["zombie", "gun", "shooting", "multiplayer", "monke"], "long_description": "# Bonker wake up. World gone. Whatever.\n\nZombies and monsters everywhere. Bonker still vibing. \ud83d\ude0e\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\n\nExplore maps, crack open boxes, hunt for gear, survive long enough to flex it.\n\nLoot stuff \u2192 Sell stuff \u2192 Get Bonk$ \u2192 Buy drip. \n\n# Multiple maps to choose from:\n- \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Bonktopia City - open, quiet, and NOT SAFE\n- \ud83e\udddf Zombie Survival - relentless waves, COD zombies vibes\n- \ud83c\udfeb School - three levels. too many footsteps.\n- \ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Space - out it the orbit, something broke into the station\n- \ud83d\udca3 War - they started it, you end it\n- \ud83d\udc1bNest - what lies underground will shock you\n- \ud83c\udffaTemple - explore the secrets of the civilizations before bonkers\n- \ud83c\udfaa Bonkland - horror carnival with dark rooms, laser pathways, & targets everywhere.\n- \ud83c\udd99 Skybonk - an Only Up inspired parkour map, with zombies of course\n\nPro Tip: Bonk with friends for more loot and more BONK$. \n\nPlay in private servers or chill in the Social Hub safe zone to hang with fellow Bonkers.\n\n**\ud83e\udd1d Come hang in discord, and meet our bonker community \ud83d\udc49 discord.gg/zombonkvr**\n", "short_description": "Survive the zombie apocalypse, loot for guns and items!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Sinn Studio Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/contact", "website_url